{% comment %}
Navigation.

The docs menu is a `<details>` disclosure rather than a hover-only dropdown:
hover menus are unreachable on touch devices and unusable by keyboard. This
works with no JavaScript at all.

Every submenu selector below is written as `.main-nav .nav-submenu` (two
classes) so it outranks `.main-nav ul` (one class, one type). Getting that
wrong is what previously left the dropdown permanently open with 20px gaps
between its items.
{% endcomment %}
<nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main">
    <ul class="nav-list">
        <li class="nav-home"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="/getting-started/">Get Started</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item-menu">
            <details class="nav-disclosure">
                <summary>
                    Docs
                    <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                        <path d="M2.5 4.5 6 8l3.5-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                              stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                </summary>
                <ul class="nav-submenu">
                    <li><a href="/docs/installation/">Installation</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/docs/configuration/">Configuration</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/docs/modules/">Analysis Modules</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/docs/api/types/">API Reference</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/docs/changelog/">Changelog</a></li>
                </ul>
            </details>
        </li>
        <li><a href="/posts/">Blog</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about/">About</a></li>
        <li>
            <a class="nav-external" href="{{ site.data.repo.url }}">
                GitHub
                <svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                    <path d="M4.5 2.5h5v5M9.5 2.5 3 9" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                          stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
            </a>
        </li>
    </ul>
</nav>
